Bugs




On Warframe Mobile, pressing the crouch button just once will cause Narin to stay slowed for the duration of Nurinarim.


Ability fails to properly deactivate when under effect of Enemy Silence from Acolyte Violence, removing players ability to attack for the duration, forcing player to flee in order to try deactivate Nurinarim to regain ability to attack Violence.






